---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ArticleRow from '../components/ArticleRow.astro';
import TopicCards from '../components/TopicCards.astro';
import { getArticles } from '../lib/catalog';
const articles = await getArticles();
const featured = ['csharp-getting-started', 'csharp-value-reference-types', 'csharp-async-await']
  .map((id) => articles.find((article) => article.data.articleId === id)!);
---
<SiteLayout title="DevWiki">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <p class="eyebrow"><Icon name="spark" size={17} />從 C#，走到雲端上的電商系統</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">把知識串起來，<br /><span>讓系統可靠地運作。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">用商品、訂單與通知理解 .NET、MySQL／PostgreSQL、Redis 與 RabbitMQ，<br class="desktop-break" />再走進 Docker、Kubernetes、GKE 與維運。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button-primary" href="/start/">開始閱讀<Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/projects/ecommerce/">先看電商案例<Icon name="network" size={18} /></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="topic-section" aria-labelledby="entry-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="entry-title">選擇你的閱讀方式</h2><p>跟著電商案例串起決策，或直接查閱一項技術的原理與排查方法。</p></div></div>
    <div class="knowledge-grid">
      <a class="knowledge-card" href="/projects/ecommerce/"><Icon name="box" size={25} /><h3>跟著電商案例學</h3><p>從商品、購物車到下單與通知，理解每項技術解決的問題。</p><span class="text-link">閱讀電商專題<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></span></a>
      <a class="knowledge-card" href="/topics/"><Icon name="code" size={25} /><h3>直接查閱一項技術</h3><p>從 C#／.NET、資料庫、Redis、RabbitMQ 到 Kubernetes，各篇可獨立閱讀。</p><span class="text-link">瀏覽所有主題<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></span></a>
      <a class="knowledge-card" href="/practice/ecommerce/"><Icon name="layers" size={25} /><h3>動手做實驗（選讀）</h3><p>需要親自觀察命中、重送或 Pod 狀態時，再準備環境操作。</p><span class="text-link">進入實作指南<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="topic-section" aria-labelledby="knowledge-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="knowledge-title">技術主題</h2><p>{articles.length} 篇技術文章，也能各自理解背景、原理和限制。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/topics/">所有主題<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></div>
    <TopicCards />
  </section>
  <section class="featured-section" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="featured-title">從這幾篇開始</h2><span class="eyebrow">編輯精選</span></div>
    <div class="article-list">{featured.map((article) => <ArticleRow article={article} />)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-note"><Icon name="book" size={20} /><p>只讀網站就能理解概念。想跟做時，再由實作指南準備環境與操作。</p></section>
</SiteLayout>
